PROBLEM: v26 changes caused USB camera black screen regression.
- enumerateConnectedDevices() calling requestPermission() for already-
  permitted devices triggered onConnect() TWICE, causing double-open
  conflict with the camera.
- setTextureView() same-instance skip prevented necessary re-registration
- Added filter/frame features that were not needed for core camera preview

FIX: Revert UVCCameraManager.kt and OperatorViewModel.kt back to v19
(abdc194) which had working USB camera preview.

v18 core fixes PRESERVED in v19 code:
- FIX #1: FORCE MJPEG + LOCK 720p (MacroSilicon freeze prevention)
- FIX #2: Bandwidth factor via 6-param setPreviewSize (1.0f)
- FIX #3: Proper surface — setPreviewDisplay(Surface) then startPreview()
- FIX #4: Surface setup on main thread via Handler
- FIX #5: remember TextureView across recompositions
- FIX #6: isInitialized guard against double init
